# Personal images; explicitly allow reviewed project artwork
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.bmp
*.tif
*.tiff
!assets/**/*.png
!assets/**/*.jpg
!assets/**/*.jpeg
!assets/**/*.webp
!assets/**/*.bmp
!assets/**/*.tif
!assets/**/*.tiff

# Large model artifacts; keep models/ itself with its marker only
/models/**
